[{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其七","author":"李东阳","text":"湘江女儿愁落晖，湘江江上鹧鸪飞。\n行人试看君山竹，竹不成斑君始归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12171,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其八","author":"李东阳","text":"戎门旌节拥高台，军士南边戍未回。\n红巾小儿齐击鼓，知是官船江上来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12172,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其九","author":"李东阳","text":"湘江水深天下清，何如陇头秋月明。\n离人到此不得醉，况是高楼吹笛声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12173,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其十","author":"李东阳","text":"长沙少年无奈春，青衫白面不生尘。\n劝君莫向湘潭住，江燕衔泥解涴人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12174,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人","author":"李兆先","text":"南国骚人忆薜萝，每逢尊酒一酣歌。\n隔年乡信春前至，入夜归心梦里过。\n旧路渐随燕树远，故山偏傍越溪多。\n阳和到处流澌尽，时送东风与碧波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12175,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李士纶南还","author":"李兆先","text":"碧水长衫映黑头，归时还及洞庭秋。\n家山别后无乡信，霄汉从来有壮游。\n惭我屋庐占上国，送君魂梦绕中洲。\n东园甘旨堪供养，正值西风白稻秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12176,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"李兆先","text":"小园散步暂徘徊，黯霭阴云去复来。\n深树欲秋黄落叶，断阶经雨碧生苔。\n频搔短发和愁乱，静掩蓬门待客开。\n无限幽怀酣睡里，日华亭午梦初回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12177,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日答所知","author":"李兆先","text":"草堂无事起常迟，闲爱逢春静爱诗。\n十日浓阴常带雨，一池空碧漫生漪。\n青回院柳莺犹涩，开到园花蝶未知。\n三尺短墙君共我，韶光如此合分谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12178,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其一","author":"李兆先","text":"酒家高楼临水边，门前柳枝好系船。\n北人过来醉一晌，南人住此又经年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12179,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其二","author":"李兆先","text":"堤上茅房已可怜，中流无家更泊船。\n去住彼此两不顾，日落荒城生暝烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12180,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其三","author":"李兆先","text":"行人折柳寄相思，又见春风换故枝。\n若问无情闲岁月，恰是新条未出时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12181,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其四","author":"李兆先","text":"秋来贾客泪沾巾，路草墙花各自春。\n莫向中流歌楚调，舟中多是赣州人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12182,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次儒珍韵","author":"谢铎","text":"莞海东头去路赊，独乘羸马到君家。\n十年梦里相寻处，依旧青山两岸花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12183,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中有怀呈十五叔父","author":"谢铎","text":"夕阳西下隔秋阴，三径门前旧竹林。\n无复惊尘随别梦，独怜多病损闲心。\n绝交书在从人弃，漫兴诗成每自吟。\n此路近来休更问，欲将青鬓谢朝簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12184,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇面寄郭筠心","author":"谢铎","text":"建水南行旧路斜，石桥青竹野人家。\n相思不及双飞鸟，红雨溪头又落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12185,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长信词","author":"谢铎","text":"芍药春深映曲栏，海棠枝上雨初残。\n合欢扇在君须记，莫放秋风一夜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12186,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新寒","author":"谢铎","text":"十月风高冷欲凝，近阳楼阁怯先登。\n浑河水落初尝骑，漕驿星驰已报冰。\n上将驱麾还笔札，内庭恩渥但金缯。\n深愁薄力知何赖，浊酒新寒漫不胜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12187,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中怀黄世显李宾之","author":"谢铎","text":"十日高眠昼起迟，缓寻方药得中医。\n不才岂是官无事，多病惟应志未衰。\n门巷雪深妨过马，江湖岁晚益多歧。\n衣冠论说今如此，旧简残灯亦自疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12188,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古木寒鸦图","author":"谢铎","text":"悬崖老树如悬藤，虬枝屈铁相崚嶒。\n阴风昼号不作雨，众鸟辟易争奔崩。\n寒鸦何来色悲壮，两两枝头屹相向。\n仰参寥廓失狐疑，熟视烟云欲狼抗。\n有时飞上朝阳殿，许身愿逐雕梁燕。\n朝阳老凤噤不鸣，鹤种鹓雏纷斥谴。\n君不见江都日暮杨柳花，至今腐草羞啼鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12189,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有旨百官带暖耳陆庶子廉伯限韵用柬西涯","author":"谢铎","text":"九陛门深障晓芃，暖寒初致感恩辞。\n争先敢羡偷狐手，再拜真同赐马骑。\n掩耳功高知不世，续貂名在愧乘时。\n炎凉几作班姬扇，恋恋谁存赠别诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12190,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汤婆次韵","author":"谢铎","text":"老来无复念专房，净扫蛾眉只素妆。\n提瓮未能忘出汲，抱衾空自热中肠。\n守宫分在宁随例，团扇恩深不怯藏。\n一点贞心祗如水，讵妨人世几炎凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12191,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邸报","author":"谢铎","text":"北窗幽梦正逡巡，忽听南来邸报频。\n鸣马一空还立仗，震雷百里尚惊人。\n痴心敢自浑忘世，浪迹犹怜未绝尘。\n感慨不知图报地，白头羞杀老词臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12192,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捩船","author":"谢铎","text":"捩船又报五更开，浪静风恬亦快哉。\n归路早知如此稳，莼鲈未熟已归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12193,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次西涯春兴韵","author":"谢铎","text":"云满青山水满池，可堪归思转迟迟。\n光荣在我真何益，愧负平生只自知。\n闲忆野芳春兴灭，坐怜庭树午阴移。\n路歧堪恨还堪笑，病骨生从未老时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12194,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤春曲","author":"张泰","text":"东风吹春染柳条，晴花卷雪烘不消。\n陌头小辇轻遥遥，绿波无情漫蓝桥。\n小雨生寒暖犹薄，尽日无眠倚朱阁。\n昨夜梨云入梦香，腰肢舞困秋千索。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12195,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春寒曲","author":"张泰","text":"鞦韆索上颠风生，侬家小院寒轻轻。\n柳眼低回晓凝碧，花颜欲破春无情。\n半捲朱帘罗袖薄，芳尘妒绣窗间落。\n安得巫山十二屏，飞入瑶台护香幕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12196,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河仙谣","author":"张泰","text":"银河迢迢界秋昊，碧沙两岸生瑶草。\n冰轮半浸练影寒，兔杵声乾桂花老。\n锦鸡宫对乌鹊桥，鸾车辗云天女娇。\n河西郎君双髻小，牵牛耕烟种兰苕。\n翠帔仙裙笑相遇，星罗斗帐秾香护。\n嬴女吹箫庆合欢，羿姬独宿啼清露。\n天上恩情惟此夕，求巧女儿那刺促。\n踆乌不管经年思，须臾飞上扶桑枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12197,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夕同诸公夜饮","author":"郑关","text":"万竹絓飞雨，流云来远天。\n高阳久寂寞，客至张华筵。\n达士不惜醉，畅饮清风前。\n阴壑度玄籁，寒声应鸣弦。\n不尽眼前欢，别后空悽然。\n狂歌马公子，达曙未能眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12198,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初寒曲","author":"张泰","text":"金钱弄霜寒浅浅，小阁云帘朝不捲。\n飘风赴闺罗袂单，翠袄出箱香冉冉。\n薰炉试手龙煤温，半床衾被愁黄昏。\n芙蓉落瓣荷干秃，幽凫还傍南塘宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12199,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨沙","author":"张泰","text":"老鲲呼乾北溟水，烛龙衔火烧余滓。\n一片狂沙乘断飙，飞度江南数千里。\n谁言天上无行人，空中乱落车马尘。\n青皇严令禁不得，掩却人间明媚春。\n羲和想迷西崦路，午景徘徊愁作暮。\n鼎湖神后拟重来，鬼蚩妒口吹黄雾。\n阴气野霾韬百灵，烟埃眯眼花冥冥。\n海天月浪洗一夜，明朝水绿山还青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12200,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"张泰","text":"翡翠楼临鸂鶒水，珠帘晓捲香风起。\n靓妆摇荡湖色澄，一样芙蓉镜花里。\n蒲深柳暗人迹稀，麦歌声里双凫飞。\n攀红采绿日易晚，夕灯愁对文君机。\n金羁白马谁家醉，桂楫迎秋减芳意。\n荷叶经霜缺旧圆，藕肠欲断丝还系。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12201,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦","author":"张泰","text":"天上寒星敛曙钟，海隅佳气溢晴空。\n东华涌出瞳眬日，南极吹来长养风。\n丹凤历端观夏正，瑶华枝上见春工。\n体元天子调元相，管领民归玉烛中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12202,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和武季丈早春游宴","author":"张泰","text":"日满寒塘冰渐开，细泉声里觉春来。\n物华天与新双眼，酒量吾应长一杯。\n野色放青回冻草，暗香凝雪上晴梅。\n病躯方藉风光慰，敢问朝簪染素埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12203,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其一","author":"张泰","text":"扶桑帝子快弯弓，百发金丸赤水东。\n惊起北溟双巨翮，等闲飞到九光宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12204,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其二","author":"张泰","text":"十二琼楼丽紫清，银河隔座泻秋声。\n翠鸾扶起瑶台月，人在仙家第五城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12205,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其三","author":"张泰","text":"海风吹绉蔚蓝天，山涌芙蓉月涌莲。\n对对凌波尘袜小，相逢多是水中仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12206,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其四","author":"张泰","text":"蓬莱水浅不容舠，欲借瑶池养六鳌。\n王母裁书报龙伯，仙源只好灌蟠桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12207,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其五","author":"张泰","text":"龙女携筐到日南，扶桑摘叶饲冰蚕。\n缫丝倩得鲛人手，为织红绡制舞衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12208,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其六","author":"张泰","text":"仙人天上好楼居，门外离离种白榆。\n一曲洞箫吹向月，夜深惊起海中乌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12209,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其七","author":"张泰","text":"鱼轩碾破水中天，雾鬓风鬟从列仙。\n鼍鼓冬冬敲向月，洞庭君女嫁泾川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12210,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其八","author":"张泰","text":"碧沙瑶草带银潢，天女停梭夜采香。\n也觉九霄风雾冷，不裁云锦寄牛郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12211,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其九","author":"张泰","text":"熊盈娘子董双成，王母前头一对行。\n天陌偶逢秦弄玉，相将凤管和鸾笙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12212,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其十","author":"张泰","text":"蟠桃熟酝九华浆，阿母临池不自觞。\n已赚穆王驰八骏，又教青鸟报刘郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12213,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其十一","author":"张泰","text":"广寒宫殿月中开，谁奉君王到上来。\n朝士无缘攀逸驾，只听归唱紫云回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12214,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其十二","author":"张泰","text":"二妃天上遇重华，锦瑟瑶琴乐帝家。\n世上狂夫休浪想，对樗蒲斗紫兰花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12215,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其十三","author":"张泰","text":"鹤笙鸾驾隔苍烟，天上那知更有天。\n不向九霄歌《白雪》，怕人知是小诗仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12216,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其十四","author":"张泰","text":"金阙西厢玉案前，众中谁是掌书仙。\n欲披小券支风月，借与琅函五色笺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12217,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其十五","author":"张泰","text":"紫泥坛上火流红，夜半天神降竹宫。\n玉器七千陈湛露，翠蛾三百舞灵风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12218,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其十六","author":"张泰","text":"白雀主人乘白龙，老刘翻领太山封。\n天翁亦自让捷足，莫怪凡夫争长雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12219,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词（十七首） 其十七","author":"张泰","text":"杨回不嫁倪君明，东岛西池各自行。\n从女九千公有伴，任他青鸟自逢迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12220,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吹笛士女图","author":"张泰","text":"冰簟银床倚石屏，芭蕉凉露湿秋庭。\n贞心试托湘江竹，吹向流云与凤听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12221,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长门月","author":"张泰","text":"昭阳歌吹晚风移，金屋春寒独睡迟。\n何事西宫杨柳月，一弯犹似妒娥眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12222,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海城春望","author":"张泰","text":"一带浮光界远田，数村花柳簇春烟。\n谁家酒幔招人醉，摇荡东风出树颠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12223,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长门春思","author":"张泰","text":"露重花垂泣，烟深柳暗颦。\n如何清禁里，有此断肠春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12224,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日睡起","author":"张泰","text":"春眠仍值酒初酣，奈可梁间燕二三。\n好梦断来何处续，落花风雨满江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12225,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"足梦中句","author":"张泰","text":"挟笙吹鹤度瀛州，雾湿云窗玉女留。\n夜半酒醒人不见，满庭明月桂花秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12226,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东风","author":"张泰","text":"最是东风管别离，年年吹发绿杨枝。\n行人去日曾攀折，每到春来有所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12227,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿雁图","author":"张泰","text":"理卷霜毛宿晚汀，旅魂应自绕秋冥。\n西风莫搅蒹葭水，月苦沙寒易得醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12228,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉宫词","author":"张泰","text":"被寒烧尽郁金香，侍女无言立近床。\n一样玉壶传漏点，南宫夜短北宫长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12229,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中暮归","author":"张泰","text":"断柳残沙不掩堤，苇丛幽称水禽栖。\n半江斜照将秋色，相送归船到竹溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12230,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"若耶溪","author":"张泰","text":"南风雨过若耶深，莲女菱歌乱别心。\n后夜繁霜凋绿盖，洞房归去理秋砧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12231,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二陆来酌闻邻家弦索声 其一","author":"张泰","text":"夜阑烧烛对残樽，欲罢犹怜客未醺。\n邻舍儿童能解事，琵琶声里惜离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12232,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二陆来酌闻邻家弦索声 其二","author":"张泰","text":"酒浅灯寒醉不成，隔墙弦语若为情。\n太平儿女中原乐，不是蛾眉出塞声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12233,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪上","author":"张泰","text":"溪上闲行日未斜，石桥南北见桃花。\n避人鱼入深深水，傍母凫眠浅浅沙。\n渡口孤舟依野店，矶头一径到渔家。\n何时谢却尘中事，来就田围学种瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12234,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南春和杜牧韵","author":"张泰","text":"细雨轻烟酿翠红，年年川谷自春风。\n伤心莫话南朝寺，多在吴王禁苑中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12235,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明仲鸣治师召亨甫宾之同过得复字","author":"陆釴","text":"李君愿有携，陈谢欣迫促。\n开门候轩车，罗张亦相逐。\n展席蔽我轩，衣袂颇连屋。\n往事一笑中，闲言坐成福。\n止吟惜幽情，折翰不远复。\n为谋知未谐，破戒诲不速。\n向来驰数笺，空费两家仆。\n犹怜君子争，胜负各清淑。\n暮雨过西山，清风动遐谷。\n盘飧愧交情，终宴无余馥。\n但喜有文辞，明珠动成掬。\n人情苦难常，世事易反覆。\n所嗟二三子，慰我颇暄燠。\n何当维白驹，于此看信宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12236,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]